&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamisushi-logo&quot;&gt;闇壽司Logo&lt;/a&gt; 著： &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tutuji&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2206092&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608966477&quot; alt=&quot;tutuji&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2206092)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tutuji&quot;  &gt;tutuji&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
