mer1090" >kumer1090</a></span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> <div class="creditBottomRate" style="position:relative;height:30px;"> <div style="text-align: center; top: 0px;"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/sushiblade-hub/%E6%81%8B%E6%98%8F%E5%B4%8E%E5%BA%97%E5%BA%97%E4%B8%BBwith%E3%83%A9%E3%82%A4%E3%83%95%E3%83%AB/medium.jpg" width="300px" alt="medium.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p>光臨！！！歡迎來到闇壽司戀昏崎店！</p> <p>Oh！客人你對闇壽司有興趣嗎？</p> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">👉你、你在講啥？</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">　</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>裝傻也沒有用哦。人家從你身上感到闇的氣息了呢。</p> <p>如果你想離開的話，先吃掉這堆油魚才能走喔。</p> <p>怎樣，是不是想知道闇壽司了？</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">👉好、好的</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">　</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>Welcome！那人家告訴你闇壽司的事喔。</p> <p>這裡你可以隨意看看。</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tabview-6152414783132e9c3f17ab5767ab7837" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>菜單</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>闇壽司陀螺玩家</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>闇壽司圖錄</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>力量的使用法</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p><strong>●闇之記錄</strong></p> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1134-jp">SCP-1134-JP</a> - <strong>爆旋握飯：壽司陀螺</strong>　著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bamboon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3591242&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608966477" alt="bamboon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3591242)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bamboon" >bamboon</a></span><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1644-jp">SCP-1644-JP</a> - <strong>壽司學院 築地校</strong>　著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fattyacid" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2081491&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608966477" alt="FattyAcid" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2081491)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fattyacid" >FattyAcid</a></span></p> <p><strong>●闇之傳言</strong><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sushiblade">新節目「握飯降臨　壽司陀螺」</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jiraku-mogana" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4062604&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608966477" alt="Jiraku_Mogana" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4062604)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jiraku-mogana" >Jiraku_Mogana</a></span><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sushi-3-2-1-hey-rassyai">最終話前加長版特別節目『回憶中的壽司陀螺！覺醒的三文猛魚！』</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tutuji" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikido